description:
["
Hello there!

With over 10 years of marketing and SEO practice, I brought fresh ideas and creativity to all my AI & SEO web projects. I have vast SEO experience working with people worldwide and consistently exceed my clients’ expectations in SEO results.

I am an entrepreneur at heart. The business aspect is one of the core reasons I started doing SEO marketing work. What appeals to me about my AI & SEO projects is assisting a fellow entrepreneur or company in expanding businesses and taking them to the next step for them to succeed through effective SEO strategies.

Most of my clients are established and successful small and medium businesses, innovative startups, well-known brands, and non-profit organizations that have benefitted from my SEO expertise.

I’m passionate and dedicated to my AI & SEO work, and I believe in delivering quality SEO results even on tight deadlines. By not giving up on SEO issues, I have developed excellent SEO troubleshooting skills and gained much experience by working on complex AI & SEO projects.

I'm seeking opportunities in these fields:
- Digital Consulting;
- AI & SEO Startegies Consulting;
- Technical SEO, On-page SEO, Ongoing SEO, Local SEO;
- ECommerce SEO, Amazon SEO, Shopify SEO;
- Youtube SEO, Quora SEO, Instagram SEO;
- HARO management, content marketing;
- Google Ads, Amazon Ads, Youtube Ads;
- Reputation Management.

I represent my SEO agency, so I can undertake big projects and provide a team of SEO specialists.
Don't hesitate to contact me with any questions or how I can help you.

Best Regards,
Dima

29/09/2026 updated
"]

