description:
['
Hello✋. I am a result-driven Full Stack expert, leading a team of Full Stack engineers and UX/UI designers - QIT Software, a Team Augmentation company, that unites professional digital creators. We can build any web and mobile product, using the latest technologies of your choice. Either you need Web & Mobile apps, scripts, libraries, and browser extensions, we can do it.

Technologies we work with:

✅ React, Vue, Angular, Node, PHP, Java, Python, .NET, C/C++, Golang, Swift, Kotlin, Flutter, Ionic, etc.
✅ SQL, MySQL, PostgreSQL, OracleDB, MongoDB, DynamoDB, MariaDB, SQLite, Fireabase, etc.
✅ AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, etc.
✅ ES6/7+, JavaScript, TypeScript
✅ Responsive CSS / CSS3 , LESS / SASS / SCSS
✅ Responsive frameworks - Bootstrap, Material UI, AntDesign, TailwindCSS
✅ GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket
✅ Figma, Zeplin, InVision, Sketch
✅ JIRA, Trello, Asana
✅ TDD, Unit testing, E2E testing

We work fast and our code is clean, w3c valid, semantic, and easy to maintain.

⚡ We take care of things and help companies to:

- extend tech teams with talents, who will exclusively work on the project;
- reach flexibility by scaling both up and down;
- avoid painful expenses of in-house hiring and recruiting agencies;
- avoid uncertainties about the right candidate;
- launch a project to production without major issues and respect your deadlines;
- save on in-house engineer team without saving on product quality;
- sufficiently decrease time-to-market;
- hit those KPIs and maximize ROI.

📍 By working with QIT Software you get:

- a streamlined onboarding time for new team members;
- an outstanding cost-quality ratio that will get more room for new ideas and features;
- simplified tax system to the reduced staff;
- stress release; we handle all the paperwork and cover all the desk costs;
- a transparent direct line of communication;
- full development process supervision of your remote team.

🚀 We help companies grow.

Send me an invitation and I will get back to you shortly. We are looking forward to building something cool with you!
']

